{"id":"n24815-2-7","stage":2,"title":"장면 · 场面","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24815-2-7-1","ko":"오늘 연극은 내용이 좀 어려웠던 것 같아.","zh":"我觉得今天的戏剧剧情有点难懂。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"연극은","meaning":"话剧，戏剧","explanation":"연극：话剧，戏剧；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"연극","audio":"/audio/ca8deda3ff79221b26a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"13977","senseId":"1","lemma":"연극","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"연극은","audio":"/audio/23d3c83659066511e627.mp3"}},{"text":"내용이","meaning":"内容","explanation":"내용：内容；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"내용","audio":"/audio/cb0f24046b508710d631.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72573","senseId":"3","lemma":"내용","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내용이","audio":"/audio/ce024bdde5fef68ac1b0.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一点点，有一点","explanation":"좀：一点点，有一点。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"1","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"어려웠던","meaning":"难懂，难解","explanation":"어렵다：难懂，难解；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"어렵다","audio":"/audio/55d0f08434308816bcaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62232","senseId":"3","lemma":"어렵다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어려웠던","audio":"/audio/0eb1a161baafbdcbc292.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아","audio":"/audio/3eb21a4d72c48bbf26ae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"ca8deda3ff79221b","term":"연극","zh":"话剧，戏剧","audio":"/audio/ca8deda3ff79221b26a4.mp3","entryId":"13977","definition":"演员在舞台上照着剧本向观众展示演技的行为。","pronunciation":["연ː극"]},{"id":"cb0f24046b508710","term":"내용","zh":"内容","audio":"/audio/cb0f24046b508710d631.mp3","entryId":"72573","definition":"言语、文章、画作、电影等的情节；或指想借此传递的信息。","pronunciation":["내ː용"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一点点，有一点","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"分量或程度稀少地。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"55d0f08434308816","term":"어렵다","zh":"难懂，难解","audio":"/audio/55d0f08434308816bcaf.mp3","entryId":"62232","definition":"言语或文章不容易理解。","pronunciation":["어렵따"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/66337fe6b0a7d6172b3c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24815-2-7-2","ko":"맞아. 난 특히 마지막 장면이 이해가 잘 안 가더라.","zh":"对啊，我尤其不太能理解最后的那个场景。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"맞아.","meaning":"正确，对","explanation":"맞다：正确，对；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66231","senseId":"1","le